<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sun Ray</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 31), Druid (guild level 41)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sun ray &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Calls down a ray of burning sunlight on the target. It needs the sun: you 
must be outdoors, under a cloudless sky, in the daytime (from five in the 
morning until nine at night). It is weak in the early morning and late 
evening, and strongest at high noon.
</p><p>A shield can block it, and it does a little more against clothes than 
against armour. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. To clear the sky 
first, see <a cmd='#'>Help Clear Skies</a>. You must be standing. It is also found on 
wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clear Skies</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Weather</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>